, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "showAllGraphs": true, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "🔼", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "", "links": [84, 249], "type": "VAE"}], "bgcolor": "#704a2a", "size": [75, 26], "color": "#4d2d1a", "pos": [20570, 6970], "inputs": [{"name": "", "link": 83, "type": "*"}], "flags": {}, "id": 60, "type": "Reroute", "properties": {"horizontal": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "showOutputText": false}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#2d2d4d", "widgets_values": ["## 🚀 Getting Started\n\nWelcome to the official Z-Anime ComfyUI Workflow!\nFollow the steps below from top to bottom and you'll have your first image in no time.\n\n---\n\n## 📦 Step 1 — Load Your Model\n\nThere are three loaders available depending on which version you downloaded.\nUse the **📦 Step 1 - Load Models Switch** node to select the right one by toggling **Yes / No**.\nOnly one loader should be active at a time.\n\n**📦 Load GGUF Models**\nFor all GGUF variants (Q4, Q8, etc.)\n\n**📦 Load Checkpoint Models**\nFor all AIO (All-in-One) versions — VAE and Text Encoder already included.\n\n**📦 Load Diffusion Models**\nFor all Diffusion format versions — loads UNet, CLIP and VAE separately.\n\n> Make sure the correct model file is selected inside the active loader node before generating.\n\n---\n\n## ✍️ Step 2 — Write Your Prompt\n\nWrite your prompt in the **✨ Positive Prompt** node.\n\n**Tip:** Look up a Z-Image prompting guide and feed it to an AI like ChatGPT — then ask it to write prompts for you. Z-Anime works best with natural, detailed descriptions rather than short tag lists.\n\nFor **Z-Anime Base** the negative prompt is fully supported and strongly recommended.\nFor the **Distill variants** (8-Step / 4-Step) the negative prompt has limited effect — you can leave it empty.\n\n---\n\n## 📐 Step 3 — Choose Your Resolution\n\nSet your output resolution in the **📐 Image Size** node.\n\nCheck the **📐 Resolution Guide** node for recommended presets:\n\n- **832 × 1216** — Portrait / Character art ⭐\n- **1216 × 832** — Landscape / Scenes\n- **1024 × 1024** — Square\n- **768 × 1344** — Full body / Tall\n- **1920 × 1088** — Cinematic / Widescreen\n- **1024 × 1536** — High quality portrait\n\n---\n\n## 🎨 Step 4 — Generate Your Image\n\nThis step contains two nodes:\n\n**🎲 Seed Control**\nSet your seed here. Switch to **fixed** if you want to reproduce the exact same image with the same prompt and settings. Switch to **randomize** to get a new result every run.\n\n**🎨 Generate Image**\nAdjust the settings depending on which model version you are using:\n\n*Z-Anime Base:*\n```\nSteps:  28–50\nCFG:    3.0–5.0\n```\n\n*Z-Anime Distill-8-Step:*\n```\nSteps:  8\nCFG:    1.0  (max ~1.5)\n```\n\n*Z-Anime Distill-4-Step:*\n```\nSteps:  4\nCFG:    1.0  (max ~1.5)\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🔼 Step 5 — Upscale (Optional)\n\nToggle the upscaler on or off with the **🔼 Toggle Upscaler ON/OFF** node.\n\n**📏 Scale Image**\nSets the upscale multiplier. Default is **1.5×**.\n\nExample:\nA 1024 × 1024 image at 1.5× becomes **1536 × 1536**.\n\n**🔄 Upscale Sampler**\nUses the same settings as **🎨 Generate Image** with one extra option — **Denoise**.\n\nThe Denoise value controls how much the upscaler changes your image:\n- **0.0** — no change, just larger\n- **0.35** — default, adds fine detail while keeping the original look ⭐\n- **1.0** — completely new image\n\n**🔍 Compare Images**\nUse this node to compare your original image side by side with the upscaled result.\n\n---\n\n*Happy generating!* 🎌"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "🎌 Z-Anime Workflow Guide", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3d3d70", "size": [630, 1120], "pos": [17678.330078125, 7047.7197265625], "id": 128, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#2d2d4d", "widgets_values": ["# 🎌 Z-Anime\n\n**Full Fine-Tune on Z-Image (Base)** — Anime-optimized model with rich aesthetics, strong diversity and full negative prompt support.\n\n---\n\n## ⚡ Quick Start\n\n1. Load model (BF16, FP8, GGUF or AIO)\n2. Write your prompt\n3. Set resolution\n4. Generate!\n\n---\n\n## ⚙️ Settings by Variant\n\n### 🎌 Z-Anime Base\n```yaml\nsteps: 28–50\ncfg: 3.0–5.0  (up to 9.0 possible)\nsampler: euler_ancestral ⭐\nscheduler: beta ⭐\nnegative: strongly recommended\n```\n\n### ⚡ Z-Anime-Distill-8-Step\n```yaml\nsteps: 8\ncfg: 1.0  (max ~1.5)\nsampler: euler_ancestral\nscheduler: beta\nnegative: limited effect\n```\n\n### 🚀 Z-Anime-Distill-4-Step\n```yaml\nsteps: 4\ncfg: 1.0  (max ~1.5)\nsampler: euler_ancestral\nscheduler: beta\nnegative: limited effect\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📦 Versions\n\n| Version | Prec. | Size | Use Case |\n|---------|-------|------|----------|\n| 🎌 Z-Anime Base | BF16 | ~12GB | Max quality |\n| 🎌 Z-Anime Base | FP8 | ~6GB | Daily use |\n| ⚡ Z-Anime-Distill-8-Step | BF16 | ~12GB | Fast + quality |\n| ⚡ Z-Anime-Distill-8-Step | FP8 | ~6GB | Fast, low VRAM |\n| 🚀 Z-Anime-Distill-4-Step | BF16 | ~12GB | Ultra fast |\n| 🚀 Z-Anime-Distill-4-Step | FP8 | ~6GB | Ultra fast, low VRAM |\n| 📦 GGUF Q8_0 | — | ~6.7GB | Low VRAM / CPU |\n| 📦 GGUF Q4_K_S | — | ~4.2GB | Very low VRAM |\n| 📦 AIO Base + 4-Step + 8-Step | BF16/FP8 | varies | Single-file (VAE+TE built-in) |\n\nAll versions run on **8GB VRAM**!\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Features\n\n✅ Rich anime style & aesthetics\n✅ Strong diversity (identities, poses, layouts)\n✅ Full negative prompt support (Base)\n✅ Natural language prompts\n✅ Fine-tunable — LoRA training ready\n✅ High resolution (up to 2048×2048)\n✅ Partially NSFW capable\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ Desktop ComfyUI Issue\n\nIf metadata save fails, replace **\"💾 Save Z-Anime\"** nodes with standard **\"Save Image\"** node.\n\n---\n\n## 📥 Links\n\n- [CivitAI Page](https://civitai.red/models/2483351)\n- [HuggingFace Repo](https://huggingface.co/SeeSee21/Z-Anime)\n- [Author — SeeSee21](https://huggingface.co/SeeSee21)\n\n---\n\n## 📦 Custom Nodes\n\n- [rgthree-comfy](https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy)\n- [ComfyUI-Lora-Manager](https://github.com/willmiao/ComfyUI-Lora-Manager)\n- [ComfyUI-GGUF](https://github.com/city96/ComfyUI-GGUF) *(for GGUF loaders)*\n- [ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler](https://github.com/numz/ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler) *(optional)*"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "📖 Z-Anime Info", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3d3d70", "size": [610, 1120], "pos": [17042.638671875, 7051.1396484375], "id": 23, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [254, 255], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["qwen_3_4b.safetensors", "qwen_image", "cpu"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "CLIP名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "类型"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "设备"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [500, 110], "pos": [18382.00390625, 7248.33154296875], "id": 89, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.6.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [253], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["z-anime-base-bf16.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "UNET名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "剪枝类型"}], "flags": {}, "type": "UNETLoader", "mod